lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="24" valign="top" style="width: 0.25in; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 1pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 1.45pt 0 0; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="88" valign="top" style="width: 65.9pt; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 1pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 5.05pt 0 0; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="background: rgba(255, 255, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="20" valign="top" style="width: 15.1pt; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 1pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 38.15pt 0 0; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr&gt;   &lt;td width="360" valign="top" style="width: 3.75in; padding: 0 5.4pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 38.15pt 0 0; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: justify; line-height: 105%"&gt;Change in fair value of interest rate swap&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="24" valign="top" style="width: 0.25in; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 1.45pt 0 0; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="88" valign="top" style="width: 65.9pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 2.15pt 0 0; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;(1,718,984)&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="20" valign="top" style="width: 15.1pt; padding: 0 5.4pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 38.15pt 0 0; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr&gt;   &lt;td width="360" valign="top" style="width: 3.75in; padding: 0 5.4pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 38.15pt 0 0; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="24" valign="top" style="width: 0.25in; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 1.45pt 0 0; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="88" valign="top" style="width: 65.9pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 5.05pt 0 0; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="20" valign="top" style="width: 15.1pt; padding: 0 5.4pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 38.15pt 0 0; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr&gt;   &lt;td width="360" valign="top" style="width: 3.75in; padding: 0 5.4pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 38.15pt 0 0; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: justify; line-height: 105%"&gt;Derivative assets, ending balance&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="24" valign="top" style="width: 0.25in; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 1.45pt 0 0; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;$&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="88" valign="top" style="width: 65.9pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 5.05pt 0 0; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;4,951,106&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="20" valign="top" style="width: 15.1pt; padding: 0 5.4pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 38.15pt 0 0; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Going Concern&lt;br /&gt;The Company does not believe that any conditions or events exist that raise substantial doubt about the entity's ability to continue as a going concern for the next year.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Concentrations of Credit Risk&lt;br /&gt;Certain financial instruments potentially subject the Company to concentrations of credit risk. These financial instruments consist primarily of cash and cash equivalents with one financial institution in an account, which exceed FDIC limits.&lt;br /&gt;The Company recognizes a concentration risk due to its exclusive reliance on sales to the California Independent System Operator (CAISO), which accounts for 100% of the Company's revenue. However, given CAISO's role as a central operator of the high-voltage power grid and its established position within California's energy market, the risk associated with this concentration is mitigated by CAISO's stable and critical operational nature.&lt;br /&gt;While any changes in CAISO's purchasing policies, financial health, or regulatory environment could potentially impact the Company's financial position, results of operations, and cash flows, the essential services provided by CAISO and its regulatory oversight reduce the likelihood of significant adverse effects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Derivative Instruments&lt;br /&gt;The Company uses variable rate debt to finance its construction. The debt obligations expose the Company to variability in interest payments due to changes in interest rates. To reduce the variability in interest payments, the Company has entered into an interest rate swap agreement to limit the fluctuations in cash flows resulting from the interest rate risk. These swaps effectively change the variable-rate cash flow exposure on the debt obligations to fixed cash flows. Under terms of the interest rate swap, the Company receives variable interest rate payments and makes fixed interest payments, thereby creating the equivalent of fixed rate debt for the notional amount.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Company accounts for this interest rate swap in accordance with the authoritative guidance for derivative instruments. The Company has not elected hedge accounting treatment. Because the Company expects to recover cash flows associated with the interest rate swap under FERC regulations, changes in the fair value of the interest rate swap are reflected in the corresponding regulatory asset or liability account during the applicable period. The changes in the fair value of the interest rate swaps are included in regulatory assets and liabilities on the Balance Sheet. For the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, the changes in the fair value of the interest rate swap included in regulatory assets of $1,718,984 and regulatory liabilities of $13,293,183, respectively.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Reclassifications&lt;br /&gt;Certain amounts in the 2024 financial statements have been reclassified to conform to 2025 presentation. In 2025, the presentation of Regulatory asset on the Balance Sheets was bifurcated into three distinct line items: Regulatory asset - AFUDC; Regulatory asset - other, net and Regulatory asset - deferred tax. These reclassifications had no effect on the previously reported results of operations or member's equity. The following table presents the comparison between the 2025 and 2024 presentation of Regulatory assets on the balance sheet as of December 31, 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="568" style="margin-left: 38.75pt; border: none" class="e-rte-paste-table"&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 15.3pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="326" valign="top" style="width: 244.75pt; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.3pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="18" valign="top" style="width: 13.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.3pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="center" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="90" valign="bottom" style="width: 67.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.3pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="center" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;2025 Presentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="18" valign="bottom" style="width: 13.5pt; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.3pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="center" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="18" valign="bottom" style="width: 13.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.3pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="center" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="97" valign="bottom" style="width: 72.95pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.3pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="center" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;2024 Presentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 15.3pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="326" valign="top" style="width: 244.75pt; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.3pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;Regulatory   asset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="18" valign="top" style="width: 13.5pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.3pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="90" valign="top" style="width: 67.5pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.3pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="18" valign="top" style="width: 13.5pt; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.3pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="18" valign="top" style="width: 13.5pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15.3pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="97" valign="top" style="width: 72.95pt; border: