ont-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 10.85pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="326" valign="top" style="width: 244.75pt; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 10.85pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 0.4in; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;Total   Regulatory asset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="18" valign="top" style="width: 13.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1.5pt double rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 10.85pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="90" valign="top" style="width: 67.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1.5pt double rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 10.85pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;37,117,412&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="18" valign="top" style="width: 13.5pt; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 10.85pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="18" valign="top" style="width: 13.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1.5pt double rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 10.85pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="97" valign="top" style="width: 72.95pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1.5pt double rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 10.85pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;37,117,412&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="text-align: left"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, GeezaPro, &amp;quot;DejaVu Serif&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none"&gt;Recent Accounting Pronouncements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, GeezaPro, &amp;quot;DejaVu Serif&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" /&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, GeezaPro, &amp;quot;DejaVu Serif&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); display: inline !important; float: none"&gt;On July 4, 2025, tax legislation commonly referred to as the &amp;quot;One Big Beautiful Bill Act (OB3 or OBBBA)&amp;quot; was enacted into law. As the Company's operations are rate-regulated, major components of the legislation, such as bonus depreciation and changes to the deductibility of business interest expense, do not apply. As such, the overall impact of OB3 did not have a material effect on the Company's financial statements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;4.  Rates and Regulatory Matters&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rate Case&lt;br /&gt;On June 29, 2023, the Company filed with FERC its initial general rate case, pursuant to section 205 of the Federal Power Act (&amp;quot;FPA&amp;quot;), in Docket No. ER23-2309-000. In an order issued September 29, 2023, FERC accepted the Company's proposed TRR, suspended it for a nominal period, to be effective March 8, 2024, subject to refund, and set the matter for hearing and settlement procedures. In a March 4, 2024, filing, DCRT informed FERC that, due to circumstances beyond its control, it would not achieve commercial operation by the originally anticipated date of March 8, 2024. Subsequently, on June 6, 2024, DCRT notified the Commission that the Ten West Link's commercial operation date was expected to be June 12, 2024. On that date, operational control of the Ten West Link was turned over to the CAISO, and DCRT became a CAISO PTO.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Transmission Revenue Balancing Account &lt;br /&gt;Section 5.2 of DCRT's Transmission Owner Tariff provides for a true-up mechanism in which the CAISO calculates any over collection or under-collection of transmission revenues compared to the authorized TRR and either credits or charges the over or under collection transmission revenues in the subsequent year through its TRBA adjustment. The TRBA is effective annually on January 1 based on the principal balance in the TRBA as of September 30 of the prior year and a forecast of transmission revenues for the next year. As of December 31, 2025 and 2024, there were $2,325,422 and $3,081,169 in under/over-collected TRBA balances within regulatory assets/liabilities on the Balance Sheets, respectively.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;5.  Regulatory Asset and Liability&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Company recorded adjustments to regulatory assets of $1,718,984 and regulatory liabilities of $13,293,183 for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively, related to the change in valuation of the interest rate swap (see Note 9). The Company is able to recover amounts paid to the interest rate swap counterparty under FERC. &lt;br /&gt;As of December 31, 2025 and 2024, $4,951,106 and $6,670,090 are presented as net regulatory liabilities, respectively.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;6.  Property, Plant and Equipment&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Property, plant and equipment consists of the following as of December 31, 2025 and 2024:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="576" style="margin-left: 36.1pt" class="e-rte-paste-table"&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 12.75pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="318" valign="top" style="width: 238.4pt; padding: 0; height: 12.75pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 2.5pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; line-height: 11.1pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="12" valign="top" style="width: 9pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0; height: 12.75pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="102" valign="top" style="width: 76.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0; height: 12.75pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="center" style="margin: 0 5.2pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: center; line-height: 11.1pt"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="30" valign="top" style="width: 22.5pt; padding: 0; height: 12.75pt"&g