p;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="102" valign="bottom" style="width: 76.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0; height: 14.1pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 1.9pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;17,672,529&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="30" valign="bottom" style="width: 22.5pt; padding: 0; height: 14.1pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 1.9pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="24" valign="bottom" style="width: 0.25in; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0; height: 14.1pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 1.9pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="90" valign="bottom" style="width: 67.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0; height: 14.1pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 1.9pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;(6,496,661)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 13.2pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="318" valign="top" style="width: 238.4pt; padding: 0; height: 13.2pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 12pt 0 0.0001pt 0.5in; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;Property, plant and equipment, net&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="12" valign="bottom" style="width: 9pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0; height: 13.2pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0.05pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="102" valign="bottom" style="width: 76.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0; height: 13.2pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0.05pt 5.2pt 0.0001pt 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;655,315,979&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="30" valign="top" style="width: 22.5pt; padding: 0; height: 13.2pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0.05pt 5.2pt 0.0001pt 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="24" valign="bottom" style="width: 0.25in; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0; height: 13.2pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0.05pt 5.2pt 0.0001pt 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="90" valign="bottom" style="width: 67.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0; height: 13.2pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0.05pt 5.2pt 0.0001pt 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;571,284,150&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;7.  Related-Party Transactions&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;In December 2015, the Company entered into a Management Services Agreement (&amp;quot;MSA&amp;quot;) with DCR Investor. The MSA was entered into to utilize DCR Investor's administrative and management resources. The MSA permits DCR Investor to bill the Company for administrative and management services performed directly by DCR Investor and certain of its affiliates. Under the MSA, DCR Investor also can seek reimbursement for costs associated with third party management services. The MSA is in effect until terminated by either of the parties in accordance with the agreement. For the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, the Company incurred total costs of $335,892 and $589,201, respectively, under the MSA. As of December 31, 2025 and 2024, the outstanding payable to DCR Investor was $228,769 and $589,201, respectively, included in Accounts payable and accrued expenses on the Balance Sheets. MSA costs incurred through the Commercial Operations Date are capitalized and included in property, plant and equipment or construction work in progress on the Balance Sheets. MSA costs incurred after the Commercial Operations Date are included in operating and maintenance expense on the Statement of Operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;8.  Long Term Debt&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;On October 31, 2022, DCRT entered a Credit Agreement with MUFG Bank LTD, ING Capital LLC and Socit Generale, (the &amp;quot;Lenders) for a Construction Loan of $264,163,349 and a Working Capital Loan of $5,000,000. There are letters of credits for unused portions of Construction and Working Capital Loans and a letter of credit for Debt Service Reserve of $11,219,185 to provide financing for TWL. DCRT incurred debt issuance costs of $4,991,694 as of December 31, 2022, which are included in Long term debt, net on the Balance Sheet as of December 31, 2025. Construction loan amounts under this contract amounted to $264,163,349 and was included in Current and Long-term liabilities on the Balance Sheet. Further, on June 28, 2024, the Construction Loan was converted into a Term Loan. The outstanding balance of the Construction Loan and Term Loan bears interest at either a Base Rate Loan or a Secured Overnight Financing Rate (&amp;quot;SOFR&amp;quot;) Loan, as the Company may request.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The Base Rate is equal to the highest of (a) Prime Rate, (b) the Federal Funds Rate plus 0.5% and (c) Daily Simple SOFR plus 1.0%, provided that the Base Rate shall not be less than 0%. The SOFR Rate shall be the Daily Simple Rate, which is the greater of SOFR or 0%. The weighted average Base Rate plus a 1.75% spread as of December 31, 2025 and 2024 are 5.43% and 6.05%, respectively. There were no outstanding balances on the Working Capital Loan as of December 31, 2025 and 2024. Upon term conversion, DCRT issued letters of credit under the Debt Service Reserve Letter of Credit. Construction Loan Letter of Credit fees are based on a rate of 1.75% for issued Letters of Credit and 0.5% for LC facility commitment fees. Construction Letter of Credit fees for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, are $25,347 and $62,117, respectively. Project Letter of Credit fees are based on a rate of 1.75% for issued Letters of Credit and 0.5% for LC facility commitment fees. Project Letter of Credit fees for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, are $18,611 and $25,556, respectively. Debt Service Reserve Letter of Credit fees are based on rates from 0.5% to 1.75%. Debt Service Reserve Letter of Credit fees for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, are $133,923 and $106,090, respectively.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Interest expenses incurred under the Construction Loan and Term Loan amounted to $16,002,546 and $17,755,317 for the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, respectively. Interest expenses are included in Interest expense on the Statement of Operations. Interest payments are made quarterly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Should DCRT default in its repayment of the Term Loan, the creditors' sole recourse against DCRT is their ownership interest in Ten West Link. DCRT is subject to various debt covenants that specify the required use of funds and require DCRT to maintain certain debt service ratios for membership disbursements. As of December 31, 2025 and 2024, DCRT was in compliance with all debt covenants.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As of December 31, 2025 and 2024, the Term Loan balance consisted of the following:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin-left: 36.1pt" class="e-rte-paste-table"&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 12.75pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="354" valign="top" style="width: 265.4pt; padding: 0; height: 12.75pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 0 0 2.5pt; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; line-height: 11.1pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="12" valign="top" style="width: 9pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0; height: 12.75pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="90" valign="top" style="width: 67.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0; height: 12.75pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="center" style="margin: 0 5.2pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: center; line-height: 11.1pt"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;spa