t;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="24" valign="top" style="width: 0.25in; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="102" valign="top" style="width: 76.5pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 5.05pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;244,865&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="342" valign="top" style="width: 256.5pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 38.15pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="102" valign="top" style="width: 76.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 5.05pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="24" valign="top" style="width: 0.25in; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="102" valign="top" style="width: 76.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 5.05pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="342" valign="top" style="width: 256.5pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 38.15pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;Gross   Advance Payable*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="102" valign="top" style="width: 76.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 5.05pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;$ 61,671,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="24" valign="top" style="width: 0.25in; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="102" valign="top" style="width: 76.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 5.05pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;$ 61,915,865&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="570" colspan="4" valign="top" style="width: 427.5pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9pt"&gt;*Calculated   as Borrowed Amount + Net Premium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;On January 5, 2023, the Company entered into a second LGIA (the &amp;quot;Second LGIA&amp;quot;) with an additional interconnection customer (the &amp;quot;Second Customer&amp;quot;), whereby the Company became obligated to expand the Switchyard to allow the Second Customer to connect its solar facility (the &amp;quot;Second Solar Facility&amp;quot;), which is still under construction, to the grid through Ten West Link, via the Switchyard.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The form of this Second LGIA and the Company's obligations thereunder are consistent with the Company's role as a CAISO PTO under the CAISO Tariff, specifically the procedures specified for Network Upgrades, (as defined in the CAISO Tariff). Under the Second LGIA, the Second Customer is obligated to finance the construction of specified upgrades to the Switchyard. &lt;br /&gt;If the Second Customer achieves commercial operation of the Second Solar Facility, the Company is obligated to reimburse the Second Customer for eligible Network Upgrade amounts, together with applicable interest, in accordance with the repayment provisions of the LGIA. Repayment generally commences upon the commercial operation date of the applicable phase of the Second Solar Facility, subject to the in-service date of the related Network Upgrades. For any Network Upgrades necessary for a completed phase that are not in service when such phase achieves commercial operation, repayment commences no later than the later of (i) the first month of the calendar year following the year in which the Network Upgrade is placed into service or (ii) 90 days after the Network Upgrade is placed into service. Repayment is made on a dollar-for-dollar basis over a five-year period unless an alternative payment schedule is mutually agreed. If the Second Solar Facility does not achieve commercial operation, reimbursement may still be required if the Network Upgrades are later used by that facility or another generating facility, in each case in accordance with the LGIA. As of December 31, 2025 and 2024, the Second Customer advanced $8,700,000 (the &amp;quot;Gross Advance&amp;quot;) to the Company under the Second LGIA. Of the Gross Amount, $6,301,000 (the &amp;quot;the Borrowed Amount&amp;quot;) is reimbursable under the Second LGIA as costs related to Network Upgrades. The remainder amount (the &amp;quot;Premium&amp;quot;) is capitalized to the advance payable subsequent to the date that the Gross Amount is greater than the Borrowed Amount and amortized over the construction process using the effective interest method. Interest Payable represents accrued interest on the reimbursement obligation under the Second LGIA.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As of December 31, 2025 and 2024, the advance payable under the Second LGIA is as follows:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="570" style="margin-left: 0.5in; border: none" class="e-rte-paste-table"&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 12.95pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="342" valign="top" style="width: 256.5pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.95pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 38.15pt 0.0001pt 0.5in; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="102" valign="top" style="width: 76.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.95pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="center" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-fa