; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="102" valign="top" style="width: 76.5pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.95pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 5.05pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 12.95pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="342" valign="top" style="width: 256.5pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.95pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 38.15pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;Gross   Premium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="102" valign="top" style="width: 76.5pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.95pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 5.05pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;$&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;2,399,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="24" valign="top" style="width: 0.25in; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.95pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="102" valign="top" style="width: 76.5pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.95pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 5.05pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;$&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;2,399,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 12.95pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="342" valign="top" style="width: 256.5pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.95pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 38.15pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;Cumulative   amortization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="102" valign="top" style="width: 76.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.95pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 2.15pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;(2,399,000)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="24" valign="top" style="width: 0.25in; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.95pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="102" valign="top" style="width: 76.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.95pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 2.15pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;(1,614,485)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="342" valign="top" style="width: 256.5pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 38.15pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;Net   Premium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="102" valign="top" style="width: 76.5pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 5.05pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;-0-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="24" valign="top" style="width: 0.25in; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="102" valign="top" style="width: 76.5pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 5.05pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;784,515&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="342" valign="top" style="width: 256.5pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 38.15pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="102" valign="top" style="width: 76.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 5.05pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="24" valign="top" style="width: 0.25in; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="102" valign="top" style="width: 76.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 5.05pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="342" valign="top" style="width: 256.5pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 38.15pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;Gross   Advance Payable*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="102" valign="top" style="width: 76.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 5.05pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;$&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;6,301,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="24" valign="top" style="width: 0.25in; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;   &lt;td width="102" valign="top" style="width: 76.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 5.05pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;$&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;7,085,515&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;td width="570" colspan="4" valign="top" style="width: 427.5pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9pt"&gt;*Calculated   as Borrowed Amount + Net Premium&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;  &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;10.  Derivative Hedging Instruments&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;DCRT uses interest rate related derivative instruments to reduce its exposure related to changes in interest rates on its variable rate debt. The Company enters into derivative instruments for the purpose of managing its market risks surrounding cash flows rather than speculating.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;By using derivative financial instruments to hedge exposures to changes in interest rates, the Company exposes itself to credit risk and market risk. The Company minimizes counterparty credit risk by entering into derivative agreements with only high-quality counterparties. The market risk associated with the derivatives is managed by establishing and monitoring parameters that limit the types and degree of market risk that may be undertaken.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Interest Rate Swaps&lt;br /&gt;DCRT's variable rate SOFR debt obligation exposes DCRT to variability in interest payments due to changes in interest rates. To limit the variability of its interest payments, DCRT entered into SOFR-based interest rate swap agreements in 2022 to manage fluctuations in cash flows resulting from changes in the benchmark interest rate of SOFR. The swap is used to convert the variable rate cash flow exposure on DCRT's long-term debt to fixed cash flows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Under the terms of the interest rate swap, DCRT pays or receives SOFR-based variable interest rate payments and fixed interest rate payments at interest rates of approximately 3.69% as of December 31, 2025, thereby creating the equivalent of fixed rate debt for the notional amount of its debt hedged. For the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, DCRT received $1,379,625 and $3,526,978, respectively, in net settlement payments under the interest rate swap agreements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As of December 31, 2025 and 2024, the total notional amount of DCRT's outstanding interest rate swap agreements were $234,786,991 and $239,492,126, respectively. The fair value of the interest rate swaps as of December 31, 2025 and 2024, was a net asset of $4,951,106 and $6,670,090, respectively. Changes in fair value of the interest rate swaps are included in regulatory assets or regulatory liabilities on the Balance Sheets. For the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, changes in the fair value of $1,718,984 and $13,293,183, respectively, represented a regulatory asset and regulatory liability respectively.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;11.  Income Taxes&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: rgba(242, 242, 242, 1)"&gt;For the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, the Company recorded the following current and deferred tax expense: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="570" style="margin-left: 0.5in; border: none" class="e-rte-paste-table"&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 12.95pt"&gt;&lt;td width="354" valign="top" style="width: 265.5pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 12.95pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 38.15pt 0.0001pt 0.5in; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="96" valign="top" style="width: 1in; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none;