t 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="96" valign="top" style="width: 1in; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 2.15pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="24" valign="top" style="width: 0.25in; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="96" valign="top" style="width: 1in; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 2.15pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 4.55pt"&gt;&lt;td width="354" valign="top" style="width: 265.5pt; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 38.15pt 0.0001pt 0.1in; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: rgba(242, 242, 242, 1)"&gt;Total   Income Tax Expense&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="96" valign="top" style="width: 1in; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 2.15pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: rgba(242, 242, 242, 1)"&gt;$ &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: rgba(242, 242, 242, 1)"&gt;6,603,140&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="24" valign="top" style="width: 0.25in; border: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="96" valign="top" style="width: 1in; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1.5pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 4.55pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0 2.15pt 0 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: rgba(242, 242, 242, 1)"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="background-color: rgba(242, 242, 242, 1)"&gt;6,568,411&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The deferred expense is largely attributable to book-to-tax differences associated with depreciation, amortization, capitalized interest income, and overcollection or under-collection of TRR. As of December 31, 2025 and 2024, the Company had a net Deferred Tax Liability of $35,407,040 and $28,958,298, respectively.&lt;br /&gt;Certain items, such as the capitalization of an allowance for funds used during construction (AFUDC) and certain other regulatory assets (the &amp;quot;Reg Assets&amp;quot;) result in a direct increase the Company's Deferred Tax Liability (&amp;quot;DTL&amp;quot;). During the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, the Company recorded direct increases to the DTL of $223,170 and $4,474,391, respectively, related to the Reg Assets.&lt;br /&gt;The statutory Federal tax rate is 21% for 2025, and 2024. The Company also pays income tax in California, which has a state income tax rate of 8.84%. The Company's effective income tax rate for 2025 and 2024 was 26.4%, and 18.8%, respectively. The Company remains subject to examination by federal and state tax authorities, subject to the appropriate statute of limitations. The difference between the Company's effective tax rate, and the Federal tax rate of 21% is attributable to California state taxes and income related to AFUDC, which is reported as other income on the statements of operations and is not subject to income tax.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The breakout of Deferred Tax Assets and Deferred Tax Liabilities as of December 31, 2025 and 2024 is as follows:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="591" style="margin-left: 0.5in; border: 3px none currentColor; width: 591px" class="e-rte-paste-table"&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 6.0686%"&gt;&lt;td width="342" valign="top" style="border: 3px none currentColor; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 14.1pt; width: 60%"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0 38.15pt 0.0001pt 0.5in; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="118" valign="top" style="border-top: 3px none currentColor; border-right: 3px none currentColor; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: 3px none currentColor; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 14.1pt; width: 19.1525%"&gt;   &lt;p align="center" style="margin: 0; font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10pt"&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="20" valign="top" style="border: 3px none currentColor; padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 14.1pt; width: 6.77966%" class=""&gt;  