        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-1028_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-1028_43151_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-1034_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-1034_43152_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-1058_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-1058_43153_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-1060_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-1060_43154_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-1065_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-1065_43157_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-1226_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-1226_43167_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-1399_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-1399_43156_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-1466_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-1466_43168_lbl" />
        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-1544_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-1544_43171_lbl" />
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-86_43091_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p><span>Amounts include $53,277 of activity on $5 Million in Plant that is not recoverable through rates.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-231_43092_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p><span>Amounts include $53,277 of activity on $5 Million in Plant that is not recoverable through rates.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-234_43093_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p><span>Amounts include $5 million in Plant that is not recoverable through rates.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-328_43100_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Amounts include $7,649,045 Plant that is not recoverable through rates and $75,631,720 of property that was funded through customer advances.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-329_43101_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Amounts include $229,414 of accumulated depreciation on $7,649,045 of Plant that is not recoverable through rates.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-427_43106_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Amounts include $148,009 of activity on $7,649,045 of Plant that is not recoverable through rates.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-457_43158_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Amounts included here relate to amortization of pre-commercial costs.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-473_43159_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Amounts include $7,649,045 Plant that is not recoverable through rates and $75,631,720 of property that was funded through customer advances.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-595_43162_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Includes $2,404,211 of overhead conductors and devices that are not recoverable through rates.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-603_43163_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Includes $547,906 of roads and rails that are not recoverable through rates.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-609_43160_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Includes $1,530,910 of station equipment not recoverable through rates.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-626_43161_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Includes $3,166,018 of towers and fixtures that are not recoverable in rates.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-852_43164_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Includes $148,009 of depreciation expense related to utility plant that is not recoverable in rates.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-870_43165_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Includes $229,414 of accumulated depreciation on $7,649,045 of plant not recoverable in rates.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-897_43166_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>The Company has recorded a contingent liability for the probable assessment of property taxes as a result of ongoing audits by Arizona and California. Because the Company includes a tracking mechanism for property taxes to ensure that customers fund only property taxes that are paid to taxing jurisdictions, a regulatory asset was recorded to represent the expected customer funding of the property tax assessment.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-907_43169_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">At December 31, 2025, the Company had a deferred Rate Case Expense balance of $6,601,030 included in Miscellaneous Deferred Debits. This balance was transferred to 182.3 in 2026 and is presented as a current year deferral.</p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">2025 - $ 6,601,030</p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">2026 - $10,954,148</p><p style="margin: 0; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Total - $17,555,178</p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-926_43170_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">At December 31, 2025, the Company had a deferred Rate Case Expense balance of $6,601,030 included in Miscellaneous Deferred Debits. This balance was transferred to 182.3 in 2026.</p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto"><br /></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1019_43155_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Property taxes accrued for the 2025/2026 assessment year were reclassified to a contingent liability pending outcome of the audit.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1028_43151_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Taxes payable for the 2024 tax year were distributed to members for payment of taxes.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1034_43152_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Taxes payable for the 2024 tax year were distributed to members for payment of taxes.</span></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1058_43153_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Property taxes accrued for the 2023/2024 assessment year were reclassified to a contingent liability pending outcome of the audit.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1060_43154_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Property taxes accrued for the 2024/2025 assessment year were reclassified to a contingent liability pending outcome of the audit.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1065_43157_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>The Company is currently under audit for property taxes by Arizona and California. This reserve represents the estimate of property taxes the Company expects to owe as a result of the audit. Amounts have been reclassified from FERC account 236, Accrued Taxes.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1226_43167_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Amounts include $148,009 of depreciation expense on utility plant not recoverable in rates.</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1399_43156_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Property taxes accrued for the 2025/2026 assessment year were reclassified to a contingent liability pending outcome of the audit.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1466_43168_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p>At December 31, 2025, the Company had a deferred Rate Case Expense balance of $6,601,030 included in Miscellaneous Deferred Debits. This balance was transferred to 182.3 in 2026 and is presented as a current year deferral.</p><p>2025 - $ 6,601,030</p><p>2026 - $10,954,148</p><p>Total - $17,555,178</p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1544_43171_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><div class="x_elementToProof" style="border: 0; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-size: 12pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1) !important">Structure mileage is an estimate based on the number of and type of structures within any given segment.</div><div class="x_elementToProof" style="border: 0; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-size: 12pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1) !important"><br style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1)" /></div></div></link:footnote>
    </link:footnoteLink>
</xbrl>